      "summary": "S3-AC1 is met: the loop config block is validated, auto_enroll_max_risk rejects material and critical (spec line 180), same-UID execution degrades to a posture that refuses policy_auto and merge_pr but allows plan and question publication, and the status Issue is updated in place; escalations are deduplicated by marker and owner commands are checked against REST login and author_association through isVerifiedActor; the Antigravity mirror and dist bundles match the source; blast radius medium (layered_config.ts effective_config shape gains a loop field, and cli.ts guard facts now take identity_posture from a live check).",
